@startuml retention-v2-metadata-trial
' ============================================================================
' The metadata ledger trial of one V2 commit (task 7926), on the objects of
' retention-v2-path-local-edit: bind_durable_transaction and
' attach_retention_v2 (rspace++/src/rspace/persistence/durable/admission.rs),
' commit_retention_v2 (retention/v2_writer.rs), run_ledger_trial
' (closure/ledger_trial.rs) and seed_retention_metadata (closure.rs). The
' theorems are T6, T6m, T7 and T7m of
' formal/rocq/stack_safe_pda/theories/RetentionV2Editor.v.
'   BLUE   #1565C0  the writer and the seeded predecessor ledger
'   GREEN  #2E7D32  activation of the successor anchor: objects that arrive
'   RED    #C62828  deactivation of the predecessor anchor: objects that leave
'   GREY   #616161  shared objects: counted, never expanded
'   PURPLE #6A1B9A  the deactivate-first negative control
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #455A64
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #455A64
skinparam NoteBorderColor #455A64
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #455A64

title <b>The metadata ledger trial of one V2 commit</b>\nactivating the successor before deactivating the predecessor expands only the objects that change

participant "Writer\nbind_durable_transaction" as W #BBDEFB
participant "Editor\ncommit_retention_v2" as E #C8E6C9
participant "Staging overlay\n(dual reader)" as S #E0E0E0
participant "Trial\nrun_ledger_trial" as T #C8E6C9
participant "Predecessor ledger\nmetadata domain" as L #BBDEFB

note over L #E3F2FD
  Seeded once at cold admission (T7): every metadata object counts
  its root multiplicity plus its occurrences as a child of a distinct
  metadata object, so X and Y count 1 (each is a child of r) and the
  anchor A counts 1. This is the ledger that activating A from an
  empty domain builds, obtained without reading an object again.
end note

W -> E : commit(A, c')
E -> S : load the old search path r, n1, L1
E -> S : stage r', n1', m, L1'', Lc and A'
E --> W : A' = (c', n + 1, r')
W -> T : run(Metadata, added [A'], removed [A])
T -> L : authorize removing A (root multiplicity 1)

group #F1F8E9 Activation of the successor anchor A' first
  T -> S : expand A', r', n1', m, L1'', Lc\n(each count crosses 0 to 1)
  T -> T : X and Y: 1 to 2, already live: not expanded
end

group #FFEBEE Then deactivation of the predecessor anchor A
  T -> S : expand A, r, n1, L1\n(each count crosses 1 to 0)
  T -> T : X and Y: 2 to 1, still live: not expanded
end

T --> W : the successor ledger, equal to the cold ledger of A'
note right of T #FFF3E0
  <b>Work</b> (T6): expansions = <latex>|M \,\triangle\, M'| = 4 + 6 = 10</latex>
  references = 2 root events + the out-degrees
  of the changed objects = <latex>2 + 5 + 7 = 14</latex>
  for one insertion or eviction, at w = 48:
  <latex>2 + \text{expansions} \le 2w + 7 = 103</latex>
end note
W -> W : attach A' and the staged nodes (with_retention_metadata)

group #F3E5F5 Negative control: deactivate first (T6m)
  T -> S : deactivate [A]: A, r, n1, L1, X, Y and every\nobject below X and Y cross 1 to 0
  T -> S : activate [A']: X, Y and every object below them\ncross 0 to 1 again
  note right of T #F3E5F5
    expansions = <latex>|M| + |M'|</latex>, which grows with
    the history; the end ledger is the same
  end note
end

group #F3E5F5 Negative control: a set seed (T7m)
  T -> L : seed every object with count 1
  note right of L #F3E5F5
    a leaf shared by two parents counts 1 instead of 2;
    evicting one alias deactivates it although the
    successor still references it
  end note
end
@enduml
